{"data": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-19T11:57:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2056705832029388831"], "id": "2056705832029388831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1168, "impression_count": 378561, "like_count": 1444, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 104, "retweet_count": 136}, "text": "后入式保姆教学·男生版\n（内容比较多，分了三篇）\n\n这是第一篇——讲的是姿势的基础：发力、进入方式、怎么动更省力、女生会更舒服\n\n后入是最受欢迎的姿势之一，但也是最容易出现撞击性疼痛的体位，写的时候考虑到了这个问题，会分别写男生&amp;女生版\n\n希望大家做的时候都享受舒服\nhttps://t.co/gg8cfkjPWO", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2056705832029388831"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-18T15:01:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2056389681957269794"], "id": "2056389681957269794", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 47130, "like_count": 64, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "现在每天都会收到很多求助答疑\n\n有时会遇到一些特别让人心疼心痛的事，比如：不知道身体需要湿润唤起才能做爱，觉得性器官流水很不正常，认为疼痛很正常\n\n说出来都是很小的事，很基本的身体知识，我们默认该知道却不知道\n\n性教育匮乏，某种程度上也导致爱的教育不完善，真心希望性教育纳入义务教育", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2056389681957269794"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-18T01:56:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2056192193979646396"], "id": "2056192193979646396", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 179, "impression_count": 163243, "like_count": 372, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 40, "retweet_count": 20}, "text": "【答疑】如果阴蒂才是一切快感来源，通过阴道纳入式刺激的方式，是不是等于隔靴搔痒\n———\n我个人比较倾向于，阴道-阴蒂-尿道，是一个三合一系统，在她们的互相作用下，产生的是综合性快感，这里面没有谁比谁更厉害or优秀，而是协同作用，让快感最大化", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2056192193979646396"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-17T20:00:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2056102488051273998"], "id": "2056102488051273998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 61, "impression_count": 116602, "like_count": 240, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 68, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "写性爱姿势教学的时候\n忽然意识到一个问题\n\n不少男生，其实对于女生性爱中的反应，很难判断是舒服、疼、还是没感觉\n\n准备单独写一篇🤗", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2056102488051273998"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-14T14:50:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2054937287369048158"], "id": "2054937287369048158", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36606, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2053828437681312186", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "ok，准备写后入式", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2054937287369048158"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-11T13:23:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2053828437681312186"], "id": "2053828437681312186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 73441, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "打算写一点性爱姿势教学\n有实际体验和实践经验的\n男女都能参考😌\n\n大家对哪个姿势最感兴趣", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2053828437681312186"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-08T04:21:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2052604831009853947"], "id": "2052604831009853947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 55827, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "评论区全是bot🫠\n我真的没辙了…", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2052604831009853947"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-07T03:37:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2052229288611516777", "2052230961329213793", "2052231390914028013"], "id": "2052231390914028013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 173, "impression_count": 154624, "like_count": 463, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 146, "retweet_count": 28}, "text": "传教士🔥\n最常用，但核心要点不在高潮，而是它是最有【亲密感】的姿势\n\n彼此对视，双臂抱紧/夹紧对方，让ta完全被圈禁在怀里\n\n我们平时几乎不会和另一个人靠这么近——整个上半身贴在一起、呼吸交错、视线无处可躲，那个距离本身就在告诉大脑：这个人离我非常近、非常安全（也有隐约的不安&amp;刺激感）", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2052231390914028013"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-06T13:35:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2052019350907887856"], "id": "2052019350907887856", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 86324, "like_count": 66, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 54, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🧐为啥做爱要被说成“吃苹果”", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2052019350907887856"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-04T12:20:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2051275733503226237"], "id": "2051275733503226237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 179, "impression_count": 273276, "like_count": 919, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 178, "retweet_count": 21}, "text": "女上姿势🌸\n刷到恋与深空最新卡牌动画，好几个都是女上位的姿势\n\n女上对女生确实更友好——节奏自己掌控，角度自己调，找到对的位置容易得多\n\n主要的快感来源其实是阴蒂蹭到男方耻骨那一片，前后或者画圈的动作让外阴持续被刺激，这是女上位高潮的真实路径\n\n某种程度上🥹视频里隔着衣服也能磨到(吧", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2051275733503226237"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-04T03:59:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2051143960786096422", "2051144846459465754", "2051149806647509075"], "id": "2051149806647509075", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 188, "impression_count": 281040, "like_count": 580, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 112, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "自慰小技巧🌷\n试着用非管用手自慰一次，右撇子用左手，左撇子用右手\n\n刚开始，动作可能会笨笨的，很不适应，感觉和惯用手完全不一样\n\n甚至会有种，第一次摸/被他人摸的感觉，因为之前所有舒服的反应，都来自一种特定的、被训练过的方式\n\n换只手，可以重新激活身体的感觉\n🔗https://t.co/b9G9BCc24q", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2051149806647509075"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-03T18:47:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2051010691755081788"], "id": "2051010691755081788", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1550583309708808193", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29558, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2049112615662559308", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "付款后👉🏼邮件提醒📧\n一共会收到2封邮件\n\n❣️第一封：收据🧾确认✅\n              这封系统秒发，如果没收到，大概率邮箱写错了，找客服or私信我\n\n❣️第二封：课程邀请链接🔗\n              这封会有延迟，不同邮箱地址速度不一样，qq/163延迟最高，一般24小时之内", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2051010691755081788"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-03T02:01:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2050757616935059869"], "id": "2050757616935059869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 38803, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 33, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "你假期最好的个人活动是\n🤔😄", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2050757616935059869"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-02T03:26:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2050416397973418442", "2050416500402434199"], "id": "2050416500402434199", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 91, "impression_count": 112942, "like_count": 282, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 57, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "一直觉得，应该把自慰这个事加入自我关怀（self-care）选项里，不仅仅是运动、洗澡、晒太阳、好好睡觉，拥抱、感恩…\n\n应该加一条【好好自慰】😌\n大脑里因此发生的——催产素、内啡肽、多巴胺、皮质醇下降，跟日常那些疗愈小事的作用，是同一套化学反应\n\n鼓励支持健康自慰💪🏼\nhttps://t.co/1HatdWToIP", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2050416500402434199"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-01T02:13:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2050035133726498974", "2050035803510759765"], "id": "2050035803510759765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1371, "impression_count": 967350, "like_count": 2241, "quote_count": 77, "reply_count": 490, "retweet_count": 202}, "text": "做了一个🔥性爱人格测试☺️\n结果测出来自己是面具大师🌚\n\n12 种类型～帮你详细解读欲望\n❥你的欲望从哪里来\n❥你的性欲是什么样的\n❥它是如何运作的\n\n成人🔞测试·仅供娱乐\n🔗https://t.co/kzcD1p20LR 🔗 https://t.co/ALxLZS0Gsq", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2050035803510759765"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-04-30T01:00:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2049655008363258009"], "id": "2049655008363258009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 39876, "like_count": 39, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "在准备全新🌟性爱人格测试\n之前弄过一个，得升级换代了\n\n之前弄完还挺满意\n现在再看是完全不够\n大家都在成长❤️我也是\n\n是时候好好看看咱的欲望从哪里来、又是如何运作的～", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2049655008363258009"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-04-28T13:17:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2049115800049500497"], "id": "2049115800049500497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 31, "impression_count": 86522, "like_count": 96, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "套套勒、不舒服是不正常的\n这是在提醒你：尺寸不对\n\n选错尺寸的话，不只是不舒服，太紧还会影响血液循环，还容易在做的过程中破损\n\n选尺寸要按勃起状态下最粗位置的周长来选，一般周长在175mm以上建议选大码\n\n戴上去应该是贴合的、不勒，也不需要太费力", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2049115800049500497"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-04-28T13:04:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2049112615662559308"], "id": "2049112615662559308", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 127581, "like_count": 54, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "𝟑𝟎𝟎𝐖+人看过的自慰教学\n‼️超全课程🥵来啦‼️\n\n高潮/寸止/延时/敏感区开发\n阴蒂阴茎 3D 结构&amp;性反应\n多重高潮 /潮吹/前列腺快感 \n\n改善不健康习惯/提升性爱❣️\n自慰· 做爱 · 身体认知一步到位\n\n男女版+真人示范 · 超详细🎬视频解析\n\n五一特惠🔥 ¥𝟏𝟗𝟗\n限时 4/30- 5/9\n👉 https://t.co/PNcuj9WIqF https://t.co/lMMpr67hU5", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2049112615662559308"}, {"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-04-28T02:18:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2048948871603122441", "2048950015863685593"], "id": "2048950015863685593", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 62939, "like_count": 139, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "前额叶这个话题最近好火\n\n高潮时，可能会让前额叶活动减弱（说「可能」是因为目前还有些争议）\n\n就会出现一种类似“掉线了”的状态，自我评判、检控的感觉减弱\n\n具体表现有：说糊话，纯口嗨，感觉自己不受控", "url": "https://x.com/MissMafiana/status/2048950015863685593"}], "includes": {"tweets": [{"author_id": "1550583309708808193", "created_at": "2026-05-11T13:23:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2053828437681312186"], "id": "2053828437681312186", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 73441, "like_count": 25, "q